@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-access-token
@boardId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@postId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@userId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@pictureId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### Public boards
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/boards?page=1

### Public topics
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts?boardId={{boardId}}&page=1

### Public replies
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts?boardId={{boardId}}&topicId={{postId}}&page=1

### Visible message or 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}

### New topic
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"boardId":"{{boardId}}","title":"Welcome","body":"Introduce yourself here."}

### Reply
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"boardId":"{{boardId}}","topicId":"{{postId}}","body":"Hello everyone!"}

### Live settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/settings

### Create board
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"General","description":"General discussions","moderation":null}

### Update board (overrides must be enabled for Pre)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"General","description":"General discussions","moderation":"Pre"}

### Moderation queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/manage/posts?state=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Publish; use Rejected to withdraw a message
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"state":"Published"}

### User overrides
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/manage/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Set user override (feature must be enabled)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/manage/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{userId}}","moderation":"Pre"}

### Soft-delete board
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/boards/{{boardId}}/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore board (developer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/boards/{{boardId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Permanently delete board (developer, refuses referenced boards)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/boards/{{boardId}}/hard/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft-delete message
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore message (developer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Permanently delete message (developer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}/hard/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft-delete user rule
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/manage/users/{{userId}}/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore user rule (developer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/manage/users/{{userId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Permanently delete user rule (developer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/manage/users/{{userId}}/hard/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Current profile picture
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/picture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove profile picture
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/profile/picture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload profile picture (replace path with a local PNG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/picture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=profile-boundary

--profile-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
--profile-boundary--

### Read current picture or 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/images/{{pictureId}}
